{"s": {"beats": [], "code": "cal = thing(\"calendar\", x=-3.4, h=3.0, color=CREAM)\nenter(cal, \"draw\")\ncamera(zoom=1.3, to=(-3.4, 0.2))\nsfx(\"whoosh\")\n\nwhen(\"100 sessions over 3 years\")\ncamera(zoom=1.0, to=(-1.8, 0.2))\nstack = thing(\"cash\", x=-0.2, h=2.6, color=CREAM)\nenter(stack, \"draw\")\ntotal = text(\"$0\", x=-0.2, y=2.1, style=\"number\", color=CREAM)\nplay(Create(total), run_time=0.5, sound=\"tick\")\ncount(total, to=100000, frm=0, prefix=\"$\", dur=1.1)\n\nwhen(\"publisher keeps 100%\")\ncamera(zoom=1.0, to=(1.6, 0.3))\npub = thing(\"factory\", x=3.5, h=3.6, color=CREAM)\nenter(pub, \"draw\")\nchart = thing(\"bar_chart\", x=3.5, h=2.2, values=[0.3, 0.6, 1.0], color=CREAM)\nmove(chart, to=(3.5, 2.2), dur=0.6)\npulse(pub)\ncamera(zoom=1.25, to=(3.5, 0.3))\n", "duration": 15.6, "narration": "Even if an actor works 100 sessions over 3 years of production, that stack of checks adds up to roughly $100,000 before taxes and agent fees. Meanwhile, the publisher keeps 100% of the billion-dollar sales chart.", "objects": [{"id": "n0", "obj": "calendar"}, {"id": "n1", "obj": "cash"}, {"id": "n2", "obj": "factory"}, {"id": "n3", "obj": "bar_chart"}], "theme": "visual", "words": [["Even", 0.0], ["if", 0.3], ["an", 0.52], ["actor", 0.76], ["works", 0.94], ["100", 1.24], ["sessions", 1.7], ["over", 2.24], ["3", 2.6], ["years", 2.82], ["of", 3.06], ["production,", 3.46], ["that", 4.14], ["stack", 4.32], ["of", 4.56], ["checks", 4.78], ["adds", 5.1], ["up", 5.34], ["to", 5.62], ["roughly", 5.74], ["$100,000", 6.04], ["before", 7.3], ["taxes", 7.72], ["and", 8.18], ["agent", 8.74], ["fees.", 8.74], ["Meanwhile,", 10.28], ["the", 11.06], ["publisher", 11.14], ["keeps", 11.5], ["100%", 11.84], ["of", 12.82], ["the", 13.0], ["billion-dollar", 13.06], ["sales", 13.76], ["chart.", 14.04]]}, "script": 1, "v": true}